const names={'head':'head','body':'body','left leg':'leftThigh','right leg':'rightThigh','left hand':'leftArm','right hand':'rightArm','left leg bend':'leftShin','right leg bend':'rightShin','left hand bend':'leftForearm','right hand bend':'rightForearm'};
export function markImportedPlayers(project){let count=0;const groups=project.groups||[],children=id=>groups.filter(g=>g.parent===id),depth=g=>{let d=0,p=g.parent;while(p){d++;p=groups.find(g=>g.id===p)?.parent;}return d;};for(const root of [...groups].sort((a,b)=>depth(b)-depth(a))){const descend=[];const walk=g=>{descend.push(g);for(const c of children(g.id))walk(c);};walk(root);const roles=new Set(descend.map(g=>names[g.name.toLowerCase().trim()]).filter(Boolean));if(!['head','body','leftThigh','rightThigh','leftArm','rightArm'].every(r=>roles.has(r))||root.playerModel)continue;if(groups.some(g=>g.playerModel&&groupMembers(project,g.id).some(id=>groupMembers(project,root.id).includes(id))))continue;root.playerModel=true;root.playerSource='bde';count++;for(const g of descend){const role=names[g.name.toLowerCase().trim()];if(role)g.playerPart=role;}for(const id of groupMembers(project,root.id)){const o=project.objects.find(o=>o.id===id);let g=groups.find(g=>g.id===o.group);while(g&&!g.playerPart)g=groups.find(x=>x.id===g.parent);if(g?.playerPart)o.playerPart=g.playerPart;}}return count;}
function worldBounds(objects){const box=new THREE.Box3();for(const o of objects){const m=new THREE.Matrix4().compose(new THREE.Vector3(...o.position),new THREE.Quaternion(...quaternionFromEuler(o.rotation)),new THREE.Vector3(...o.size.map((v,i)=>v*(o.mirror?.[i]||1)))).multiply(new THREE.Matrix4().makeRotationFromQuaternion(new THREE.Quaternion(...(o.rightRotation||[0,0,0,1]))));for(const part of o.colliderParts||[{c:[0,0,0],s:[.5,.5,.5],q:[0,0,0,1]}])for(const x of [-1,1])for(const y of [-1,1])for(const z of [-1,1])box.expandByPoint(new THREE.Vector3(x*part.s[0]/2,y*part.s[1]/2,z*part.s[2]/2).applyQuaternion(new THREE.Quaternion(...part.q)).add(new THREE.Vector3(...part.c)).applyMatrix4(m));}return box;}
